-- Liberty HomeCare (UW-RPP-W-001-06-V): the Introduction and the Definitions (CÁC ĐỊNH NGHĨA),
-- except the nine Insured Perils (homecare-perils.l4), the Deductible (GC13, in
-- homecare-general-conditions.l4) and Actual Value (homecare-part1.l4), which are encoded
-- where they are used. Quotations (`src:N`) are line N of ../../source/raw/liberty-homecare.txt.
--
-- The defined terms are capitalised in the source and are kept so when quoted. A fork ID
-- (F-...) points at NOTES.md section 3; a finding (Finding N) at section 4.

§ `Introduction`

§§ `What the document is, and the duty to read it`

-- Inert. The first sentence describes the document; the second puts a duty to read on the
-- Insured with no consequence attached to it; the last says whom to ask.
