GIVETH A STRING
`the Introduction, as a description of the document` MEANS
    "The Insured will find here the cover available, the Insurer's terms and conditions, and how to claim; the Insured should read it with the other documents of the Insurance Contract."

§§ `When the Insurer's liability begins`

-- Operative. Unless the Insurer has agreed to issue the Certificate and/or the Policy
-- Summary, its liability begins only when it has received and accepted a completed Proposal
-- Form AND the premium has been paid in full within the prescribed time. Either limb suffices
-- (F-attach). The "prescribed time" is not stated in this document; whether it was met is
-- the input `the premium was paid in full within the prescribed time`.
-- src:21 | Trừ khi Công Ty Bảo Hiểm đã đồng ý ban hành Giấy Chứng Nhận Bảo Hiểm và/hoặc Bản Tóm Tắt Hợp
-- src:22 | Đồng Bảo Hiểm, trách nhiệm bảo hiểm của Công Ty Bảo Hiểm chỉ bắt đầu có hiệu lực khi Công Ty Bảo
-- src:23 | Hiểm nhận được và chấp nhận Giấy Yêu Cầu Bảo Hiểm đã điền đầy đủ và Phí Bảo Hiểm đã được
-- src:24 | thanh toán đầy đủ trong thời hạn quy định.
@ref Introduction, src:21-24
GIVEN policy IS A `The policy`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`cover has attached under` policy MEANS
        policy's `the Insurer agreed to issue a Certificate or the Policy Summary`
    OR      policy's `the Insurer received and accepted a completed Proposal Form`
        AND policy's `the premium was paid in full within the prescribed time`

