    WHERE
        premises MEANS policy's `the premises`

-- "The Home does not include", limbs (c)-(g), which turn on the building as a whole.
-- (c) F-home-c: the limb lists "hotels, guest houses, infirmaries, boarding houses, the kinds
-- of houses and apartments, strata-title apartments or mobile homes". Read literally, "the
-- kinds of houses and apartments" excludes every house and every apartment, which empties the
-- definition it qualifies. Taken: (c) names establishments of those kinds (hotels and the like,
-- strata-title apartments, mobile homes), not the house or apartment the definition admits.
