GIVEN property IS A LIST OF `A description of property`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the property is part of the Home` property MEANS
        (    "the building"  ... `is` `the house or apartment itself`
         ..  "(a)" ... (    `is` `an outbuilding, garage, fixture or improvement`
                        OR  `is` `an in-ground pool, tennis court, in-ground spa, sauna, jetty or pontoon`)
                   ... `is` `used for domestic purposes`
         ..  "(b)" ... `is` `fixed lighting, wall, ceiling or fixed floor covering`
         ..  "(c)" ... `is` `a service above or below ground`
                   ... `is` `owned by the Insured or the Insured must repair, replace or pay for it`
         OR  "(d)" ... (    `is` `landscaping`
                        OR  `is` `a paved path or paved driveway`
                        OR  `is` `a retaining wall or garden wall`
                        OR  `is` `a fence or gate`)
                   ... `is` `on the land of the Home`)
    AND NOT (    "does not include (a)" ... `is` `a carpet, curtain or internal blind`
             ..  "(b)" ... `is` `an unpaved path or driveway of earth or gravel`
             OR  "(h)" ... (    `is` `trees, shrubs, grass or other living plants`
                            OR  `is` `soil, sand, gravel, bark or mulch`))
    WHERE
        `is` d MEANS elem d property

